  <p id="c-nanqishu-033-zhangxu-wangjian:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　<persName id="c-nanqishu-033-zhangxu-wangjian:p001:m0002" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAACA">張緒</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-033-zhangxu-wangjian:p001:m0005" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAACA">思曼</persName>，吳郡吳人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-033-zhangxu-wangjian:p001:m0015" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAA">茂度</persName>，會稽太守。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-033-zhangxu-wangjian:p001:m0024" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAC">寅</persName>，太子中舍人。</p>
